{"updated":"2026-11-23T02:59+00:00","warnings":[{"event":"Flood Warning: River Ottery at Yeolmbridge and Ham Mill","level":"amber","headline":"Flooding is expected: River Ottery at Yeolmbridge and Ham Mill","description":"Rising river levels are expected to cause flooding overnight. \n\nFlooding is expected from overnight on Sunday 22 November . \n\nHeavy rain has fallen throughout Sunday and river levels have risen through the evening. \nProperties and low lying areas will start to flood from around 11:30pm on Sunday into Monday. The main areas of concern are properties and low lying areas around Leat Cottages and the B3254. Flood waters may be deep and fast flowing in these areas. \nRiver levels are forecast to be at their highest overnight into Monday morning, with further rain forecast through into Tuesday. \n\nWe are closely monitoring the situation . \n\nMonitor local water levels and weather conditions. Avoid low lying roads near rivers. Even shallow water can damage a car. \n\nThis message will be updated by 11:00AM on Monday 23 November or as the situation changes.","impacts":["Flooding is expected - act now"],"onset":"2026-11-22T23:49:34+00:00","expires":"2026-11-24T23:49:34+00:00","areas":[{"name":"River Ottery at Yeolmbridge and Ham Mill","polygons":[[[50.655,-4.347],[50.655,-4.348],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.349],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.35],[50.655,-4.351],[50.655,-4.351],[50.655,-4.351],[50.655,-4.351],[50.655,-4.351],[50.655,-4.351],[50.655,-4.352],[50.655,-4.352],[50.655,-4.353],[50.655,-4.353],[50.655,-4.353],[50.655,-4.353],[50.655,-4.353],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.354],[50.655,-4.355],[50.655,-4.355],[50.655,-4.356],[50.655,-4.356],[50.65